    "These controls mirror the Lock Screen tab so you can tune the media overlay while focusing on playback settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "이 제어기는 '잠금 화면' 탭과 연동되어 있어, 재생 설정에 집중하면서도 미디어 오버레이를 세밀하게 조정할 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deze bedieningselementen weerspiegelen het tabblad Vergrendelscherm, zodat je de media-overlay kunt afstemmen terwijl je je richt op de afspeelinstellingen."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Эти элементы управления дублируют настройки экрана блокировки для удобства."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ปุ่มควบคุมเหล่านี้สะท้อนแท็บหน้าจอล็อกเพื่อให้คุณปรับโอเวอร์เลย์สื่อขณะเน้นการตั้งค่าการเล่น"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bu kontroller Kilit Ekranı sekmesini yansıtır, böylece oynatma ayarlarına odaklanırken medya katmanını ayarlayabilirsiniz."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些控制镜像了锁屏标签页，方便您在关注播放设置的同时调整媒体覆盖层。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These indicators appear in the notch when apps are using your camera or microphone, matching macOS's native privacy indicators.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "앱이 카메라 또는 마이크를 사용 중일 때 노치에 표시기가 나타나며, 이는 macOS의 기본 개인정보 보호 표시기와 동일하게 작동합니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deze indicatoren verschijnen in de inkeping wanneer apps je camera of microfoon gebruiken, wat overeenkomt met de eigen privacy-indicatoren van macOS."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esses indicadores aparecem no notch quando os aplicativos estão usando sua câmera ou microfone, correspondendo aos indicadores de privacidade nativos do macOS."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Эти индикаторы появляются в вырезе, когда приложения используют камеру или микрофон."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ตัวบ่งชี้เหล่านี้ปรากฏในรอยบากเมื่อแอปใช้กล้องหรือไมโครโฟนของคุณ ตรงกับตัวบ่งชี้ความเป็นส่วนตัวเดิมของ macOS"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bu göstergeler, uygulamalar kameranızı veya mikrofonunuzu kullanırken çentikte görünür ve macOS'un yerel gizlilik göstergeleriyle eşleşir."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当应用使用您的相机或麦克风时，这些指示器会出现在刘海中，与 macOS 原生隐私指示器一致。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These temporary HUDs recreate the charging, low-battery, and full-battery notch alerts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deze tijdelijke HUD's reproduceren de waarschuwingen voor opladen, batterij bijna leeg en batterij vol."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Эти временные HUD воссоздают уведомления зарядки, низкого и полного заряда для предпросмотра."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HUD ชั่วคราวเหล่านี้สร้างการแจ้งเตือนรอยบากการชาร์จ แบตเตอรี่ต่ำ และแบตเตอรี่เต็มใหม่"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些临时提示框再现了充电、低电量和充满电时的刘海提醒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is optional. You can change it any time from the menu bar.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "이 설정은 선택 사항입니다. 언제든지 메뉴 막대에서 변경할 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
