    "Works with most media apps, including browsers, to detect what's playing. Note: This may be removed in a future macOS version.": {
      "comment": "Description of a media controller type when it works with most media apps, including browsers, to detect what's playing. Note: This may be removed in a future macOS version.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "브라우저를 포함한 대부분의 미디어 앱에서 재생 중인 항목을 감지합니다. 참고: 이 기능은 향후 macOS 버전에서 제거될 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Werkt met de meeste media-apps, inclusief browsers, om te detecteren wat er wordt afgespeeld. Opmerking: dit wordt mogelijk verwijderd in een toekomstige macOS-versie."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Работает с большинством медиаплееров."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ใช้ได้กับแอปสื่อส่วนใหญ่ รวมถึงเบราว์เซอร์ เพื่อตรวจจับสิ่งที่กำลังเล่น หมายเหตุ: อาจถูกลบใน macOS เวอร์ชันอนาคต"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Neyin oynatıldığını algılamak için tarayıcılar dahil çoğu medya uygulamasıyla çalışır. Not: Bu, gelecekteki bir macOS sürümünde kaldırılabilir."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "支持大多数媒体应用（包括浏览器）来检测正在播放的内容。注意：此功能可能在未来的 macOS 版本中被移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
